- The TAPNext++ checkpoints tapnextpp_ckpt.pt (256) and tapnextpp_512.ckpt (512), downloaded into weights/. Apache
  License, Version 2.0, as third_party/tapnet/README.md ("License and Disclaimer") and
  third_party/tapnet/tapnet/tapnextpp/README.md ("License") state for the checkpoints released and linked there.
